  (text "ProFile bus. U2 carries the eight data lines both ways (DIR and /OE from the FPGA). U3 brings the six host-driven control lines in. /PBSY, /PPARITY and PCHK are driven by the FPGA through 220 R. All ProFile-side nets are 5 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9ab4a99d-1a69-5738-b5fb-31bf0d50c0e9"))
